.tmp-composewebview-src/
**/.tmp-composewebview-src/
.tmp-composewebview-jvm-src/
**/.tmp-composewebview-jvm-src/
.tmp-wrywebview-src/
**/.tmp-wrywebview-src/
/main/

# Local cast debug captures
.cast-freeze-logcat*.txt
